00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:54,800
Link, start

251
00:17:06,940 --> 00:17:07,770
Asuna

252
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:14,660
Okay.

253
00:17:24,060 --> 00:17:26,120
I'm going to fight hard.

254
00:17:27,520 --> 00:17:29,740
And I will beat him.

255
00:17:31,500 --> 00:17:32,780
Link, start!

256
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:43,630
Incoming!

257
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:47,880
Oh my gosh, Klein! Are you okay?

258
00:17:51,340 --> 00:17:52,580
Come on, guys!

259
00:17:52,900 --> 00:17:55,253
What are you waiting for, an invitation?

260
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:57,360
He's being extra manly today.

261
00:17:57,560 --> 00:17:58,557
Yeah, tell me about it.

262
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:00,217
Hang on, Klein, we're coming!

263
00:18:00,300 --> 00:18:01,653
Take your time, ladies!

264
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:03,180
Don't go! Crap!

265
00:18:09,780 --> 00:18:10,610
Poison gas!

266
00:18:12,780 --> 00:18:13,780
Hold your breath!

267
00:18:15,780 --> 00:18:16,610
Asuna!

268
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:20,500
Hey! Asuna!

269
00:18:20,780 --> 00:18:22,180
Need a hand here!

270
00:18:24,780 --> 00:18:26,220
Alpine to Asuna! Ah!

271
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:31,260
Sue, Nila, Hale, Astro!

272
00:18:35,940 --> 00:18:36,770
Yes!

273
00:18:37,600 --> 00:18:38,430
Hey!

274
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:46,900
I'm sorry, guys.

275
00:18:47,180 --> 00:18:49,356
I didn't mean to space out like that.

276
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,600
Nah, it's all good.

277
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:52,212
No harm, no foul, right?

278
00:18:52,300 --> 00:18:54,257
Yeah, today's your boy's big day.

279
00:18:54,340 --> 00:18:56,340
That's right, Kirito's tournament.

280
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:57,934
It's gonna start soon.

281
00:18:58,020 --> 00:18:59,437
I don't know about you guys,

282
00:18:59,520 --> 00:19:02,517
but I say we quit early and get
over to our room to watch it.

283
00:19:02,600 --> 00:19:05,777
I say we use the cash we scored
today to buy beer and snacks.

284
00:19:05,860 --> 00:19:09,919
Do you honestly think we're gonna
let you blow all our money on food?

285
00:19:10,240 --> 00:19:11,660
Don't you worry, Mommy.

286
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:14,998
Daddy's gonna win today, you'll see.

287
00:19:15,940 --> 00:19:16,770
Sure he will.

288
00:19:17,040 --> 00:19:20,569
No matter where he goes, Kirito
knows how to handle himself.

289
00:19:23,740 --> 00:19:24,570
Hey, guys,

290
00:19:24,740 --> 00:19:26,217
we don't want to miss the first match,

291
00:19:26,300 --> 00:19:28,637
so let's start heading
over to Yggdrasil City.

292
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:29,550
Okay.

293
00:19:47,320 --> 00:19:49,620
Come on, folks, place your bets.

294
00:19:58,080 --> 00:19:58,910
Xenon!

295
00:20:01,660 --> 00:20:02,760
Hey, Spiegel.

296
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:04,880
It's almost time.

297
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:07,220
I believe in you.

298
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:09,979
I know you're gonna win this thing.

299
00:20:11,860 --> 00:20:12,690
Thanks.

300
00:20:13,260 --> 00:20:15,000
So, what are you gonna do?

301
00:20:15,420 --> 00:20:19,596
Well, I thought I'd find a bar
somewhere and watch the feed from there.

302
00:20:20,060 --> 00:20:20,890
Cool.

303
00:20:20,973 --> 00:20:23,557
I'll track you down after this
and we can toast my victory.

304
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:24,816
Or cry in our beers.

305
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:29,430
Sinon.

306
00:20:29,513 --> 00:20:30,640
I mean, Asada.

307
00:20:31,180 --> 00:20:32,280
Yeah, what's up?

308
00:20:32,520 --> 00:20:35,520
I was wondering if you
meant what you said earlier.

309
00:20:35,620 --> 00:20:36,720
What did I say?

310
00:20:37,660 --> 00:20:39,954
You asked me to wait for you, remember?

311
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:43,157
After you won this thing and
conquered your fears, we...

312
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:46,097
Then maybe we could go
out and stuff? What the...

313
00:20:46,180 --> 00:20:47,860
You're bringing this up now?

314
00:20:48,580 --> 00:20:51,980
It's just that I care
about you so much, Asura.

315
00:20:54,840 --> 00:20:56,200
Don't do this now.

316
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,880
I have to focus on the tournament.

317
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:00,230
I'm sorry,

318
00:21:00,380 --> 00:21:04,968
but I don't have a chance of winning
unless I put everything I've got into it.

319
00:21:05,960 --> 00:21:06,790
Right.

320
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:07,900
I understand.

321
00:21:10,020 --> 00:21:11,980
Even so, I believe in you.

322
00:21:12,220 --> 00:21:14,102
And I'll wait till you're ready.

323
00:21:14,740 --> 00:21:15,570
Okay.

324
00:21:15,820 --> 00:21:16,650
I...

325
00:21:16,733 --> 00:21:20,260
Well, I better go get ready now. See ya.

326
00:21:22,700 --> 00:21:24,840
I'll be rooting for you. Good luck.

327
00:21:53,260 --> 00:21:54,860
I won't lose today.

328
00:21:55,820 --> 00:21:57,300
I won't either!

329
00:22:24,360 --> 00:22:27,160
Thank you.

330
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:50,480
I don't need one thing to do.

331
00:22:53,060 --> 00:22:57,377
I'm stronger and stronger!

332
00:22:57,460 --> 00:22:59,077
I'm going to cry.

333
00:22:59,160 --> 00:23:01,617
I'm going to cry. I'm going to cry.

334
00:23:01,700 --> 00:23:03,480
I'm going to cry.

335
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:26,717
See you

336
00:23:26,800 --> 00:23:33,380
next time.

337
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:38,320
Next time, Bullet of Bullets.
